sequenceDiagram
    participant Consumer as Consumer Thread
    participant Cond as Condition Variable
    participant Mutex
    participant Producer as Producer Thread
    participant Queue
    
    Consumer->>Mutex: pthread_mutex_lock(&mutex)
    Consumer->>Queue: Check if empty
    Queue-->>Consumer: Empty
    
    Consumer->>Cond: pthread_cond_wait(&cond, &mutex)
    Note over Consumer: Atomically releases mutex, and waits
    
    Producer->>Mutex: pthread_mutex_lock(&mutex)
    Producer->>Queue: Add item
    Queue-->>Producer: Item added
    
    Producer->>Cond: pthread_cond_signal(&cond)
    Note over Producer: Wake one waiting thread
    Producer->>Mutex: pthread_mutex_unlock(&mutex)
    
    Note over Consumer: Wakes up, reacquires mutex
    Consumer->>Queue: Get item
    Queue-->>Consumer: Item
    Consumer->>Mutex: pthread_mutex_unlock(&mutex)
    
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Consumer,Producer: Condition variables coordinate, producer-consumer patterns
    end
